'''White Wind''' (風 (白), ''Kaze (Shiro)'', '''Wind (White)''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 10.10 Update|Version 10.10]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = White Wind
|image = E 580.png
|money drop = 250¢ - 987¢
|appearance = [[JRA Collaboration Event]]<br>
[[Heartbeat Catcademy#List of Stages|Weekend: Confession]]<br>
[[Monthly Event All-Stars Grateful Gathering]]
}}

==Enemy==
A weak enemy that can knockback units. Although it may seem pathetic, all but two stages it appears in have unit restrictions that heavily limit your options against this enemy. Still, its rather weak stats means it could only be threatening in large hordes or at high magnifications.

==Strategy==
Due to how most stages White Wind appears in have heavy unit restrictions, there really isn't much strategy but to hope your plus levels on either [[Secret Crush Cat (Special Cat)|Secret Crush Cat]] or any of the JRA Collaboration units are high enough to deal with them.

==Variants==
{{Variant
|original = White Wind
|Red Wind
|White Wind's [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] variant. Has a higher movement speed, two more knockbacks and a 100% chance to [[Weaken|weaken]] Cat Units to 50% for 1 second instead of knockback.
|Dark Wind
|White Wind's [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant. Has 50% higher attack, 10 knockbacks and 12 movement speed, but has no special ability whatsoever.
}}

